      "content": "it doesn't feel like i'm being strong anymore. it just feels like i'm being stubborn. like i'm just dragging this heavy body around for no reason. if i could just let go and not have to deal with the guilt or the emptiness or even the breathing... wouldn't that just be the kindest thing for me? it feels like the only way to finally be at peace.",
